  "full_text": "I just did the clothes and I made the mistake of putting all the clothes in one compartment. So I kind of got in trouble for putting too many jeans in one load with Dad's and these are cut-offs and so I said, well they should fit now. So I put them all in one load. Then I realized I put my wallet in there. and it gets worse. So then my parents had some papers from the mail, because my dad sorts the mail on the washing machine. So earlier today, I was like, oh, fuck it. And so I took the papers, and I... Anyway, I sort of moved them, so I didn't screw up totally. So right, so then... So then I come out here and I have to find my wallet because it's in the washing machine. So the question is, Terry, how fast are you and how good is your IQ? So I didn't find a wallet very quickly. It was completely soaked. And so then I put the wallet on the side and then I got the papers wet. So then I got my parents' papers wet. So it gets worse. Anyway, so... So now I got a wet wallet because I fell from grace. So I was in here taking my video for Diana and I changed my routine and fell from grace and didn't record and stuff. And anyway, so that was interesting. Falling from grace, it's kind of like, so you get further in life and then you realize what you fucked. fucked up and the question is uh do highs and lows balance yes so is it inevitable i don't know what if doing grace is so grace itself must be a pain in the ass otherwise it wouldn't be any worth anything so anyway",
